                "JavaScript": "// The status sent is a row of the case Status value list (by Code) whose\r\n// Closed Status is not set: closing a case is Resolve case's. Columns are\r\n// matched whatever their case, spaces or underscores.\r\n(() => {\r\n  const key = name => String(name).replace(/[\\s_]/g, '').toLowerCase();\r\n  const get = (row, name) => row[Object.keys(row).find(column => key(column) === key(name))];\r\n  const code = String(activities.EndpointData.Output().Body.Status ?? '').trim().toLowerCase();\r\n  const row = activities.StatusList.ResultSet().find(item => String(get(item, 'Code') ?? '').trim().toLowerCase() === code);\r\n  return code !== '' && !!row && !/^(true|1|yes|y)$/i.test(String(get(row, 'Closed Status') ?? '').trim());\r\n})()"
              }
            }
          ],
          "propertyStorageProviders": {}
